[background arg="res://Assets/Cutscenes/1.png" fade="0.0"]
A warm summer's day, a child was born kissed by the gentle sunrays and caressed by the cool breeze.
The small shire she was born to had rolling hills, proud trees, and jolly people.
[background arg="res://Assets/Cutscenes/2.png" fade="0.0"]
The country elsewhere was wartorn, but she does not know it yet—
Ghouls have ravaged the land just three years prior, and people from the north had to flee to the capital Terazza for refuge.
[background arg="res://Assets/Cutscenes/3.png" fade="0.0"]
Where once a child born would be born ot the city to be enscribed, no such thing is imaginable now. The roads had grown dangerous as the conflict goes on.
[background arg="res://Assets/Cutscenes/1.png" fade="0.0"]
label Naming Input
The town namer has found her name, {CONSTS.Ana}. But trouble befalls this name. And for reasons you don't know your uncle suggests something usually frowned upon.
You must don a temporary name before the time for your real name comes.
[text_input text="What will you be called?" var="INPUT.PlayerName"]
if {INPUT.PlayerName}  ==  "Ana":
	jump Naming Input
elif {CONSTS.Ana} == "ana":
	jump Naming Input
[background arg="res://Assets/Cutscenes/4.png" fade="0.0"]
{INPUT.PlayerName} was a peculiar child. Growing up, she was trained in magic under Uncle. Although compared to her peers she was lagging well behind.
[background arg="res://Assets/Cutscenes/5.png" fade="0.0"]
Through trial and error, uncle had figured it out\: dear {INPUT.PlayerName} has a strange relationship with magic.
[background arg="res://Assets/Cutscenes/6.png" fade="0.0"]
The child has no intuitive grasp on the semantics of magic, rather she get's stuck viewing magic at it's individual components.
Once she learned how to put them together however, she could cast as well as other children albeit in a much slower speed.
[background arg="res://Assets/Cutscenes/7.png" fade="0.0"]
Over time, her skill had proved to be useful. Her discerning sense of parts and segments made her a prodigy in dispelling spells and locks. A skill more advanced for even practicing magicians.
[background arg="res://Assets/Cutscenes/4.png" fade="0.0"]
She proved to be one of Uncle's last few students over the years.
As the war waged on, families pulled their children out of study in fear that they will be conscripted and sent to battle by the capital.
Perhaps because of {INPUT.PlayerName}'s gratitude, or maybe familial ties, that she continued to study under his tutelage.
[background arg="res://Assets/Cutscenes/8.png" fade="0.0"]
And today, Uncle tells {INPUT.PlayerName} that something calls her. One that calls her by her true name\: {CONST.Ana}.